The nodes is 4.
The large is 1000000.
The times is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 2 into times.
Place 1 into times.
Place 1 into times.
Place 2 into times.
Place 3 into times.
Place 1 into times.
Place 3 into times.
Place 4 into times.
Place 1 into times.
The graph is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 15.
Place large into graph.

For every spot from 0 to 3.
Set item (spot times 4 plus spot) of graph to 0.

For every pair from 0 to 2.
The base is pair times 3.
The source is item base of times.
The target is item (base plus 1) of times.
The weight is item (base plus 2) of times.
The slot is source minus 1.
The place is target minus 1.
The here is item (slot times 4 plus place) of graph.
If weight is less than here, set item (slot times 4 plus place) of graph to weight.

For every middle from 0 to 3.
For every start from 0 to 3.
For every finish from 0 to 3.
The first is item (start times 4 plus middle) of graph.
The second is item (middle times 4 plus finish) of graph.
The through is first plus second.
The direct is item (start times 4 plus finish) of graph.
If through is less than direct, set item (start times 4 plus finish) of graph to through.

The answer is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 3.
The distance is item (4 plus spot) of graph.
If distance is more than answer, set answer to distance.

If answer is at least large, show -1, otherwise show answer.
